  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first-floor side window, by virtue of its siting, would introduce unneighbourly overlooking towards the private garden amenity spaces of both nos. 9 and 11 King Edward Road. This is to the detriment of continued enjoyment of these spaces and would therefore cause harm to residential amenity. This is contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 57 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024),&amp;nbsp;which seeks to protect the privacy of neighbours.&lt;/p&gt;"
